{"chunk_id": "1f7ea32fcfec", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "统一大市场产业动态", "date_hint": "2025年7月31日", "text": "国家发展改革委召开上半年发展改革形势通报会，会议强调，纵深推进全国统一大市场建设，破除“内卷式”竞争，深入推进招标投标制度改革，规范地方招商引资行为，推动要素顺畅流通，促进民营经济健康发展、高质量发展。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "1f7ea32fcfec", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "ff735183e920", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "统一大市场产业动态", "date_hint": "2025年7月1日", "text": "权威人士主持召开中央财经委员会第六次会议，研究纵深推进全国统一大市场建设、海洋经济高质量发展等问题。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "ff735183e920", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "f0c413f32b23", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "统一大市场产业动态", "date_hint": "2025年1月7日", "text": "1月7日电，国家发改委印发《全国统一大市场建设指引(试行)》的通知。其中提出，各地区、各部门要严格落实“全国一张清单”管理模式。地方依法设定的市场准入管理措施，要全部列入全国统一的市场准入负面清单管理。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "f0c413f32b23", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
