{"chunk_id": "a127f0894fe5", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "现代物流体系是全国统一物流市场的重要基础", "date_hint": "", "text": "2、土地流转，以及耕地占补平衡和高标准农田建设，将助力农机行业实现量价齐升。\n土地流转:是指土地使用权流转，对拥有土地承包经营权的农户将土地经营权(使用权)转让给其他农户或经济组织，即保留承包权，转让使用权。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "a127f0894fe5", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
